{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33353","headline":"关山月 · 翁绶","name":"关山月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"裴回汉月满边州，照尽天涯到陇头。\n影转银河寰海静，光分玉塞古今愁。\n笳吹远戍孤烽灭，鴈下平沙万里秋。\n况是故园摇落夜，那堪少妇独登楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁绶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}